{"sections":[{"slug":"StefanichHigherQCoh","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"StefanichHigherQCoh"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Higher Quasicoherent Sheaves"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">参考资料</span>. "},"author":{"Plain":"Germán Stefanich"},"page-title":{"Plain":"Higher Quasicoherent Sheaves"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"参考资料"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>https://gstefanich.github.io/Thesis.pdf</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>My PhD thesis. The first half contains a number of results in the theory of enriched higher categories, culminating in a discussion of monads and the enriched monadicity theorem. The second half builds upon the two papers below and develops the theory of quasicoherent sheaves of (∞, n)-categories in derived algebraic geometry.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">来源</span>: https://gstefanich.github.io/</p>\n</blockquote>\n"}}}]}